content:
Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Student",
      "description": "Learner receiving tutoring support",
      "attributes": [
        "Availability",
        "Progress Record",
        "Tutor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Availability",
      "description": "Times when the student is free for tutoring"
    },
    {
      "name": "Progress Record",
      "description": "Notes on a student’s learning progress"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tutor",
      "description": "Instructor providing tutoring to the student"
    },
    {
      "name": "Subject",
      "description": "Topic the student wants to study"
    },
    {
      "name": "Homework Question",
      "description": "Student-submitted questions for the tutor"
    },
    {
      "name": "Parent",
      "description": "Guardian managing the student’s tutoring arrangements"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tutoring Package",
      "description": "Purchased bundle of tutoring sessions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tutoring Session",
      "description": "Scheduled lesson between student and tutor",
      "attributes": [
        "Subject"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Academic Coordinator",
      "description": "Staff member managing tutor assignments and oversight"
    },
    {
      "name": "Learning Plan",
      "description": "Plan outlining learning goals and steps for the student"
    }
  ]
}
```
